    "detailed_description": "Adopt a new pet and embark on this journey to help him find a safe place and give his new pet an identity.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo achieve such a feat you must go back to the golden age of video games and remember how things were back then (good old days)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* back and forth items<br />\r\n* Platforms with precise jumps<br />\r\n* Move objects around the scene to solve puzzles<br />\r\n* Use physics to your advantage whenever possible<br />\r\n* And when it's time to run you'll know, so run, run like there's no Checkpoint.",
